# Arch AUR package metadata for openjiuwen-connect

These PKGBUILD + wrapper-script + install-hook files are released under the
[0BSD license](https://spdx.org/licenses/0BSD.html), matching the convention
of the AUR repo itself.

The packaged upstream software (OpenJiuwen Connect) is Apache-2.0 licensed;
see `/usr/share/licenses/openjiuwen-connect/LICENSE` after install.